<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21788" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλγις</span></b> , ἡ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλγι&lt;&gt;θος</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλγιος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιδος</span> (in codd. freq. with false accent <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελγίς, γελγίθος</span>, etc., but cf.
			Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.87
		</span></i>): pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλγεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					7.4.11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				1.4.5
			</span></i>:—<i>head of garlic</i>, and in pl., the
				<i>cloves</i> which compose it, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γέλγις διαιρεῖται εἰς τὰς γέλγεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HP</u>
					7.4.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				77
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότιμοι γέλγῑθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.232
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
